@startuml
title Evidence lifecycle and custody boundaries
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #0B0B0F
skinparam defaultFontColor #F4F1E8
skinparam ArrowColor #C89B3C
skinparam stateBorderColor #D8C184
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #171922
skinparam stateFontColor #F4F1E8

[*] --> Capturing
Capturing : Timestamped camera/audio frames
Capturing --> Buffered : encode and segment
Buffered : Bounded local ring buffer
Buffered --> Preserved : authorized trigger and pre/post window
Buffered --> Expired : retention policy overwrite
Preserved : Segments protected from ordinary overwrite
Preserved --> Sealed : hash, manifest, journal, encrypt
Sealed --> Queued : synchronization policy permits
Queued --> Transferring : WAN available
Transferring --> Queued : interruption / retry
Transferring --> Received : verified remote receipt
Received --> Retained : retention / legal-hold policy
Retained --> Exported : role and approval checks
Exported : Encrypted package + manifest + audit
Retained --> Disposed : authorized, journaled disposition
Expired --> [*]
Disposed --> [*]

note bottom of Sealed
  Original media is distinct from
  derived AI annotations.
end note
@enduml
